  "ingredients": [
    "2 tablespoons butter",
    "0.5 cup orzo pasta",
    "0.5 cup diced onion",
    "2 cloves garlic, minced",
    "0.5 cup uncooked white rice",
    "2 cups chicken broth"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4A7KsrCpiveFLWtvKjCFDsj_oRM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/203951-Sarahs-rice-pilaf-step1Mise_38453-fa1029c9e4c24833ba9a833072d7f467.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/203951/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt butter in a skillet over medium-low heat. Add orzo; cook and stir until orzo is golden brown.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/VV6xQ0Zm3wFYC_yDY-dRuK6xYNg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/203951-Sarahs-rice-pilaf-step2_38455-7c52332630a0475c8eb4b1a6414ff37c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/203951/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in onion and cook until onion becomes translucent.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/k4b90lQ3n4V9dAIeeuHAA9PEzhE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/203951-Sarahs-rice-pilaf-step3_38460-2433a341796e4c6f8a5a03f09bdb9654.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/203951/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add garlic and cook for 1 minute. Stir in rice and chicken broth, turn heat to high, and bring to a boil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fAF88JjEYeoKqfPy_O5eISIRGzE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/203951-Sarahs-rice-pilaf-step4_38465-56f823e1b3d149e48b623751e2dfb5b3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/203951/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reduce heat to medium-low, cover the skillet, and simmer until rice is tender and liquid has been absorbed, 20 to 25 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove from the heat and let stand, covered, for 5 minutes. Fluff with a fork before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0zdeZ9-eP_Y-Qn5OosVLLd9QQMU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/203951-Sarahs-rice-pilaf-step6_38487-2e4c179ff54c45abb0cb7222ec8f6d9b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/203951/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
